title: "Mergen Scope"
abstract: "A free, open-source, offline-capable browser workspace for viewing and analyzing spectrum analyzer, VNA Touchstone (.s1p–.s16p) and oscilloscope measurement files, with Smith chart, RF analysis and publication-ready LaTeX (pgfplots/TikZ) export."
